{
  "name": "sdk-config-plugins-skills",
  "about": "sdkSessionConfig.plugins 的 skill / command 面（ProjectRuntimeRegistry.ts:993-1020 resolveSdkSessionPlugins 按路径加载插件，ProjectSessionRuntimeBundle.ts:247-311 acquireSessionContributions 把会话插件并进本会话的 contributions）：系统提示词的 available-commands / available-skills 段列出会话插件的 command 与 skill，限定 skills 时替换后的 read_skill 能读会话插件的 skill；不限定时默认 read_skill 只看项目插件，读不到（基线如此）；不带 plugins 的会话看不到它们；commands_list 不含会话插件的 command（GatewayCommandCatalogBundle.ts:46-58 只看项目插件）。",
  "files": {
    "proj/sess-plugin/plugin.json": "{\"name\": \"sess-plugin\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\"}\n",
    "proj/sess-plugin/skills/delta/SKILL.md": "---\nname: delta\ndescription: The delta skill shipped by the session plugin.\n---\n\n# delta\n\nReply with DELTA.\n",
    "proj/sess-plugin/commands/hello.md": "---\ndescription: Say hello from the session plugin.\n---\n\nSay hello.\n"
  },
  "provider": [
    {
      "name": "title",
      "when": [
        "Generate a concise title"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "{\"title\": \"Plugin run\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "after-read",
      "when": [
        "\"tool_call_id\":\"call_d"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "text": "Done."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "read-delta-1",
      "when": [
        "turn-1:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_d1",
          "name": "read_skill",
          "arguments": {
            "skillName": "sess-plugin:delta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "read-delta-2",
      "when": [
        "turn-2:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_d2",
          "name": "read_skill",
          "arguments": {
            "skillName": "sess-plugin:delta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "read-delta-3",
      "when": [
        "turn-3:"
      ],
      "reply": {
        "tool": {
          "id": "call_d3",
          "name": "read_skill",
          "arguments": {
            "skillName": "sess-plugin:delta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "reply": {
        "text": "ok"
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-pl1",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-1: plugin only",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "plugins": [
            {
              "type": "local",
              "path": "{PROJECT}/sess-plugin"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-pl2",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-2: plugin and skills",
        "sdkSessionConfig": {
          "plugins": [
            {
              "type": "local",
              "path": "{PROJECT}/sess-plugin"
            }
          ],
          "skills": [
            "delta"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "submit_turn",
      "params": {
        "sessionKey": "s-pl3",
        "channelKey": "test",
        "message": "turn-3: no plugin"
      }
    },
    {
      "sleep": 300
    },
    {
      "ws": "commands_list",
      "params": {
        "projectKey": "{PILOT_HOME}",
        "sessionKey": "s-pl1"
      }
    }
  ]
}
